n at the end of FY2026, against $375 billion a year earlier. That is 206.1% of FY2026 revenue (computed from two filed figures).","cites":["MSFT.rpo.2026","MSFT.rpo.2025","MSFT.revenue.2026"]},{"topic":"backlog","text":"Deferred revenue was $75.7 billion at the end of FY2026 (tagged ContractWithCustomerLiability), against $67.3 billion a year earlier.","cites":["MSFT.deferred.2026","MSFT.deferred.2025"]},{"topic":"people","text":"The latest annual report gives the workforce as 223,000 in its own words. FY2026 revenue works out to about $1.5 million for each (computed from one filed figure and the number in that sentence).","cites":["MSFT.q.employees","MSFT.revenue.2026"]},{"topic":"debt","text":"At the end of FY2026 the balance sheet carried $20.9 billion in cash and cash equivalents and $55.9 billion in short-term investments, and $40.3 billion of debt as tagged (LongTermDebtNoncurrent + LongTermDebtCurrent). Cash and short-term investments exceeded that debt by $36.5 billion (computed from four filed figures).","cites":["MSFT.cash.2026","MSFT.sti.2026","MSFT.debtLong.2026","MSFT.debtCurrent.2026"]}]},"fin":{"MSFT":{"insiders":{"from":"2025-11-23","to":"2026-11-23","complete":true,"listed":139,"read":139,"other":0,"failed":0,"odd":0,"people":[["Numoto Takeshi","EVP, Chief Marketing Officer"],["Hood Amy","EVP, Chief Financial Officer"],["Nadella Satya","Chief Executive Officer, director"],["Althoff Judson","CEO Microsoft Commercial"],["Coleman Amy","EVP, Chief Human Resources Off"],["Hogan Kathleen T","EVP, Strategy"],["STANTON JOHN W","Director"],["SMITH BRADFORD L","Vice Chair and President"]],"rows":[["S",0,5000,2655000,"2026-11-10","2026-11-10","0000789019-26-000234","2026-11-12",0],["S",1,7305,3976633.39,"2026-11-09","2026-11-09","0000789019-26-000232","2026-11-10",1],["S",1,7305,3984302.99,"2026-10-13","2026-10-13","0000789019-26-000226","2026-10-14",1],["S",1,41674,20764844.52,"2026-09-14","2026-09-14","0000789019-26-000212","2026-09-15",1],["S",2,86525,43388